          "stats": {
            "id": "levelled_description_0761215fbae0",
            "level": {
              "value": 5
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "The shared bond between you and your allies allows you to act on their behalf.\n\nDuring your daily preparations, you can perform a simple ritual with up to five willing Small or Medium humanoids, where participants exchange minor tokens of personal significance. As long as you hold onto a participant's token, you can assume their form with your Change Shape ability, gaining a +4 status bonus to Deception checks to pass as that person and adding your level to the check even if you're untrained. You lose access to a participant's form if they're not carrying your token or if you use the ritual again."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
